OL,3,GNEWSACould giant tuna fishing be set
OL,4,Afor a comeback?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For a UK fish they are the most
OL,7,Fexciting and spectacular you can get by
OL,8,Fa country mile, no question."
OL,10,FCatching an Atlantic bluefin tuna is
OL,11,Foften a career highlight for an angler.
OL,13,FLast weekend a commercial vessel's crew
OL,14,Fcaught and landed a 338kg fish off the
OL,15,Fcoast of Whitby, becoming the first to
OL,16,Fdo so in the North Sea for an estimated
OL,17,F60 years.
OL,19,FThe following day, they did it again,
OL,20,Fwith the story generating national and
OL,21,Finternational headlines.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
